&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Group Accountant, you will play a key role in ensuring accurate, timely and high-quality consolidated financial reporting for the Awin Group under IFRS. You will take ownership of key consolidation and reporting processes, support group-wide accounting topics, and contribute to the continuous improvement of our reporting systems and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
