&lt;li&gt;Drive process and system improvements in the group reporting and consolidation landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of contact for local finance teams on group-wide IFRS and consolidation-related accounting topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as process owner for Awin’s consolidation tool LucaNet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role offers the opportunity to take ownership of key group reporting processes and contribute to the further development of Awin’s international finance and consolidation landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
