&lt;li&gt;Structured, accurate and proactive way of working, with the ability to deliver high-quality results in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and prioritise effectively during tight reporting deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in group accounting, consolidation or audit environment preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional qualification such as CPA, ACCA, ACA, IFRS Accountant, German “Bilanzbuchhalter” is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
